        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9028/305, 12 Inch Bilbao Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPart of the modern industrial design trend, the 12 Inch Bilbao Cabinet Pull is easy to install. This 12 inch cabinet pull will be sure to make a statement and is perfect for larger cabinets. The Bilbao 12 Inch Cabinet Handle is available in modern finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9028\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/bilbao-4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9028-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/bilbao-6-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9028-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/bilbao-8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9028-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/bilbao-10-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9028-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/bilbao-18-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9028-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9028 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
